\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\u001b[6D\u001b[K\n\"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -\u001b[1D\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\u001b[6D\u001b[K\n\"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -\u001b[1D\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\u001b[6D\u001b[K\n\"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -\u001b[1D\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\u001b[6D\u001b[K\n\"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -\u001b[1D\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\u001b[6D\u001b[K\n\"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -\u001b[1D\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\u001b[6D\u001b[K\n\"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -\u001b[1D\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\u001b[6D\u001b[K\n\"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" -\u001b[1D\u001b[K\n-- \"Error\" -- \"Error\" --  -- \"Error\" -- n.it?\nIt's been a while since I posted anything, but as you can see here, I'm bac\u001b[3D\u001b[K\nback in business again! The reason for my absence of course is the fact tha\u001b[3D\u001b[K\nthat I was away on holiday with the family for two weeks. And I also have t\u001b[1D\u001b[K\nto admit that I've been really busy lately. But enough about me and let's t\u001b[1D\u001b[K\ntalk a little bit more about this game we all love.\nSo, as you know, this game isn't just your average score or even your high \u001b[K\nscore in a single round; it's the total of your high scores in your career \u001b[K\nthat counts for your final score at the end. But the question is: how does \u001b[K\nthis impact your strategy?\nWell, when I started playing this game seriously and strategically (i.e., n\u001b[1D\u001b[K\nnot just shooting willy-nilly), I found out some things that really change \u001b[K\nthe whole way you play the game.\nFirst of all: don't shoot the same gun for every single round! Every single\u001b[6D\u001b[K\nsingle time I was shooting with the same gun, I kept a high score, but my c\u001b[1D\u001b[K\ncareer went nowhere and eventually it would get stuck at one point. So what\u001b[4D\u001b[K\nwhat you should do is to use different guns for different things; this coul\u001b[4D\u001b[K\ncould mean using a high-damage gun when you need to clear the map quickly, \u001b[K\nor using low-damage guns (like a shotgun) when you have to move around a lo\u001b[2D\u001b[K\nlot more. It's all about adapting your playstyle based on what's happening \u001b[K\nin the game right now!\nSecond: save that high score for later. Whenever I had a really good round \u001b[K\nand got a high score, instead of just shooting away like crazy, I would sta\u001b[3D\u001b[K\nstart conserving my bullets for when I needed them the most (i.e., when I h\u001b[1D\u001b[K\nhad to clear out a whole map). That way, your career would go up by leaps a\u001b[1D\u001b[K\nand bounds! It's all about knowing when to conserve or waste your ammo.\nThird: don't be afraid to switch to another weapon if you need to. Sometime\u001b[8D\u001b[K\nSometimes, the best course of action is not \"shooting like a madman\", but s\u001b[1D\u001b[K\nswitching to something else that can do the job better (i.e., using an area\u001b[4D\u001b[K\narea-of-effect gun instead of a single target one). It all boils down to fi\u001b[2D\u001b[K\nfinding what's working at the moment and stick with it!\nI hope this helps you in your quest for higher scores and better strategies\u001b[10D\u001b[K\nstrategies! Let me know if there are any questions, ideas or feedback.",
